        "content": "## Metricool – List Boards helper (run as needed)\n\nPulls every Pinterest board name + ID from Metricool into the **Tailwind Boards** tab (kept under its original name — board IDs are native to Pinterest, so nothing else needs to change), for new boards you want to add to the Category map.\n\n**Setup:** Google Sheets + Metricool (Header Auth, X-Mc-Auth) credentials. Set userId and blogId in Set Config. Then click Execute — it appends every board it finds, so review for duplicates before copying rows into use.",
